function coopShortenFor(events,recipient,recipientRow,recipientSlot){let total=0;for(let x of events)if(coopAllyMatchesEffect(x.effect,x.owner,recipient,x.source,x.deckRow,recipientRow,recipientSlot))total+=shortenValue(x.effect);return total}
function coopBuildSkillTimeline(decks,lastSlot){let shortens=[],available=new Map(),counts=new Map();for(let row=0;row<decks.length;row++)for(let slot=0;slot<COOP_SLOTS;slot++){let c=decks[row]?.[slot];if(!c)continue;let turn=Number(c.details?.skillTurn??0);counts.set(coopTimelineKey(row,slot),Number.isFinite(turn)?turn:0)}for(let source=0;source<=lastSlot;source++){if(source>0)for(let [key,value] of counts)counts.set(key,value-1);let changed=true;while(changed){changed=false;for(let row=0;row<decks.length;row++){let owner=decks[row]?.[source],key=coopTimelineKey(row,source);if(!owner||available.has(key)||(counts.get(key)??Infinity)>0)continue;let effects=skillEffectsOf(owner).filter(coopStructuredEffectValid),turn=Number(owner.details?.skillTurn??0);available.set(key,{owner,row,source,turn:Number.isFinite(turn)?turn:0,availableTurn:source,effects});for(let effect of effects){if(en(effect)!=='短縮')continue;let amount=shortenValue(effect);if(amount<=0)continue;shortens.push({effect,owner,source,deckRow:row});for(let recipientRow=0;recipientRow<decks.length;recipientRow++){let recipientSlot=source,recipient=decks[recipientRow]?.[recipientSlot],recipientKey=coopTimelineKey(recipientRow,recipientSlot);if(!recipient||available.has(recipientKey))continue;if(coopAllyMatchesEffect(effect,owner,recipient,source,row,recipientRow,recipientSlot))counts.set(recipientKey,(counts.get(recipientKey)??0)-amount)}changed=true}}}}return{shortens,available,counts}}
function coopAvailableSkills(deck,slot,enemyAttr){let timeline=coopBuildSkillTimeline([deck],slot),active=[],activated=[];for(let source=0;source<=slot;source++){let state=timeline.available.get(coopTimelineKey(0,source));if(!state)continue;activated.push(state);for(let effect of state.effects){if(en(effect)==='短縮')continue;let duration=effectDuration(effect);if(source+duration>slot)active.push({effect,owner:state.owner,source,duration,remaining:source+duration-slot})}}let recipient=deck[slot],shorten=coopShortenFor(timeline.shortens,recipient,0,slot);return{active,shorten,activated}}
function coopAllDeckSkills(slot,recipient,enemyAttr='',recipientRow=null,preparedTimeline=null,preparedDecks=null){let decks=preparedDecks||coopDecks.slice(0,coopVisibleRows),timeline=preparedTimeline||coopBuildSkillTimeline(decks,slot),active=[],sources=[];for(let row=0;row<decks.length;row++){let states=[];for(let source=0;source<=slot;source++){let state=timeline.available.get(coopTimelineKey(row,source));if(!state)continue;states.push(state);for(let effect of state.effects){if(en(effect)==='短縮')continue;let duration=effectDuration(effect);if(source+duration>slot)active.push({effect,owner:state.owner,source,duration,remaining:source+duration-slot,deckRow:row,recipientRow,recipientSlot:slot})}}sources.push({row,state:{activated:states}})}let shorten=coopShortenFor(timeline.shortens,recipient,recipientRow,slot);return{active,shorten,sources}}
function coopConditionText(value,fallback='指定なし'){let v=String(value??'').trim();return v||fallback}
function coopAllyCondition(e){let scope=coopConditionText(e?.applier,'味方'),attr=coopConditionText(e?.applierAttribute,'全');return `${scope} / 味方属性:${attr}`}
